# Task 2: Build Fix Log — nvpro_core2 API Migration
Timestamp: 2026-06-30

## Summary
Fixed all compilation errors caused by the nvpro_core2 submodule update (7c7998c → eb7c2f2).
Both Debug and Release builds now succeed with 0 errors.
ctest: tcp_depth_e2e passes; unit_tests has pre-existing SIGTRAP (nvutils Logger debug break, not a regression).

## Root Causes

### 1. CameraManipulator::Camera struct changes (Double Precision Camera)
The nvpro_core2 Camera struct was updated to double precision:
- `glm::vec3 eye/ctr/up` → `glm::dvec3 eye/ctr/up`
- `float fov` → `double fov`
- `glm::vec2 clip` → `glm::dvec2 nearFar` (renamed)
- Added: `glm::dvec2 orthMag`, `ProjectionType projectionType`

### 2. nvvk::Swapchain API restructure
- `m_maxFramesInFlight` → `m_framesInFlight` + `m_imageCount` (separate concepts)
- `m_imageFormat` → `m_surfaceFormat.surfaceFormat.format`
- Semaphores restructured: `acquireSemaphore` per frame slot, `presentSemaphore` per image
- Method `screenShot()` → `saveScreenShot()` in nvapp::Application
- `getSpeed()` now returns `double` instead of `float`

## Files Modified

### src/camera_set.h (3 fixes)
- `applyNvutilCamera()`: Added `glm::vec3()` casts for eye/ctr/up, `static_cast<float>()` for fov, `glm::vec2(nvuCam.nearFar)` for clip
- `toCamera()`: Same pattern — explicit casts from dvec3/double to vec3/float
- `toNvutilCamera()`: Reverse casts — `glm::dvec3()` for eye/ctr/up, `static_cast<double>()` for fov, `glm::dvec2(camera.clip)` for nearFar

### src/vk_viewer.h (1 fix)
- Changed `m_eye`, `m_center`, `m_up` from `glm::vec3` to `glm::dvec3` (camera API now uses double)
- Changed `m_lastSortCameraPosition`, `m_lastSortCameraDirection` from `glm::vec3` to `glm::dvec3`

### src/vk_viewer_frame.cpp (2 fixes)
- Added `glm::vec3()` casts when assigning m_eye/m_center/m_up to ctx.eyePosition/centerPosition/upVector (which remain vec3)
- Changed `currentDirection` local from `glm::vec3` to `glm::dvec3`

### src/vk_viewer_render.cpp (2 fixes)
- Added `glm::vec3()` casts for ctx assignments (same as frame.cpp)
- Added `glm::vec3()` cast for updateLccStreaming call

### src/vk_viewer_frame_ubo.cpp (1 fix)
- Added `glm::vec3()` cast for `prmFrame.cameraPosition = glm::vec3(m_eye)`

### src/vk_viewer_rtx.cpp (1 fix)
- Changed `ref_cam_matrix` from `glm::mat4` to `glm::dmat4` (matches getViewMatrix return type)
- Changed `ref_fov` from `float` to `double`

### src/vk_viewer_sorting.cpp (1 fix)
- Added `glm::vec3()` casts for sortAsync arguments (glm::normalize result and m_eye)

### src/vk_viewer_ui.cpp (2 fixes)
- `m_app->screenShot()` → `m_app->saveScreenShot()` (method renamed in nvpro_core2)
- `auto speed = cameraManip->getSpeed()` → `auto speed = static_cast<float>(...)` (return type changed to double)

### src/nvvk_swapchain_override.cpp (removed from build)
- File was rewritten to match new API but caused duplicate symbol errors with upstream libnvvk.a
- Fix: Excluded from build via CMakeLists.txt FILTER
- HDR format detection lost (upstream Swapchain now supports preferredFormat via InitInfo)

### CMakeLists.txt (1 fix)
- Added `list(FILTER SOURCE_FILES EXCLUDE REGEX "nvvk_swapchain_override\\.cpp$")` to exclude the override file

### Files NOT modified (by requirement)
- No nvpro_core2 files were modified

