## Test Results

### ctest --output-on-failure
- tcp_depth_e2e: PASSED (42.70s)
- unit_tests: SIGTRAP — PRE-EXISTING, not caused by migration
  - Cause: `nvutils::Logger::breakOnErrors()` raises SIGTRAP on all `LOGE()` calls in debug builds
  - Trigger: "NPZ Loader - Non-existent File" test calls `canLoad()` on non-existent file, which logs `LOGE("NPZ: Failed to open file: ...")`, triggering the debug break
  - This is by design (helps catch errors during development) and predates the submodule update

## Known Issues
1. HDR automatic format detection lost with nvvk_swapchain_override.cpp removal
   - Mitigation: Upstream Swapchain supports `InitInfo::preferredFormat` for HDR format selection
2. Future PR slots: unit_tests SIGTRAP needs resolution (e.g., use LOGW instead of LOGE in npz_loader.cpp)

